---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About Us | MarineCharter Comparison Hub">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Our Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-3">Connecting Travelers with Premier Marine Charters</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-slate-600">
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>MarineCharter</strong>, an independent comparison portal dedicated to private catamarans, luxury speedboats, and marine excursions worldwide.
      </p>
      <p>
        Founded by hospitality and travel technology professionals, our platform helps groups, families, and solo travelers evaluate private charter options with transparent group pricing, menu inclusions, and route details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">How We Operate</h2>
      <p>
        We aggregate listing data from verified local tour suppliers and international booking platforms (such as Viator and GetYourGuide). We do not collect direct payments or mark up prices; all bookings are processed securely through official partner checkouts.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Contact & Support</h2>
      <p>
        Have questions about listing your vessel or using our comparison tools? Reach out to our team at 
        <a href="mailto:support@marinecharter.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">support@marinecharter.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>